            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f3" n="3" xml:id="d218-f3-content">
                <p>Regarding Smith’s statement in Santiago on July 31, 1957, in which he expressed
                    abhorrence at “any form of excessive police action,” see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >The Fourth Floor</hi>, pp. 18–23.</p>
            </note>
